  "description": "<h1>Remote Language Projects – Native &amp; Fluent Speakers</h1>\n<p><strong>Remote | Independent Contractor </strong></p>\n<p>iMerit, an EXL Company, is looking for native or fluent speakers of <strong>Burmese, Persian, Khmer, Maltese, and Slovenian</strong> for upcoming remote language projects.</p>\n<p><strong>How to Apply</strong></p>\n<p>Complete the short form and select <strong>only the language you are proficient in and wish to be assessed for</strong>. Our team will review your submission and share the relevant application link for that language.</p>\n<p>Please apply only for languages in which you have native or fluent proficiency.</p>\n<p><em>Project opportunities are subject to availability and successful completion of the applicable assessment.</em></p>",
