 {
  "url": "https://www.workingnomads.com/job/go/1939843/",
  "title": "AI Trainer",
  "description": "<p>AI Trainer</p>\n<p>Remote   |   Independent Contractor   |   Get certified for future project opportunities</p>\n<p>Prove your skills. Get certified. Be ready for what comes next.</p>\n<p>Robotics AI is advancing rapidly, and high-quality video data helps intelligent systems better understand the world around them. We are inviting detail-oriented professionals to complete our certification process for potential robotics AI projects. Demonstrate your skills now and be considered when project opportunities become available.</p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p>▌ What you will do</p>\n<p>As part of the certification process, you will demonstrate your ability to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Annotate short video clips by identifying objects, actions and events.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Evaluate video quality, relevance and accuracy against established guidelines.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Assess the clarity and plausibility of movements.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Apply instructions consistently and identify potential quality issues.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>▌ What you bring</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Strong attention to detail and analytical thinking.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Strong written English and the ability to follow detailed instructions independently.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A commitment to accuracy and consistency.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>No previous AI or robotics experience required.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>▌ What the work looks like</p>\n<p>You may review short videos and be asked to tag objects or actions, rate video clarity or camera angles on a 1 to 10 scale, or assess whether movements are clearly visible and plausible.</p>\n<p>▌ Why get certified now</p>\n<p>Completing certification in advance allows you to demonstrate your qualifications and be considered for relevant independent contractor engagements when opportunities become available.</p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p>Please note:  Certification does not guarantee a project engagement, assignment or paid work. Future opportunities depend on project availability and applicable selection criteria.</p>",
  "company_name": "iMerit Technology",
  "category_name": "Administration",
  "tags": "trainer,english,quality",
  "location": "United states, Norway, United Kingdom, Sweden, New Zealand, Argentina, Australia, Austria, Belgium, Brazil, Bulgaria, Canada, Czech Republic, Denmark, Dominican Republic, Estonia, Finland, Germany, Greece, Hungary, India, Indonesia, Ireland,",
  "pub_date": "2026-10-14T00:29:00-04:00"
 },
 {
  "url": "https://www.workingnomads.com/job/go/1938564/",
  "title": "Senior Full-stack PHP Developer",
  "description": "<p>Are you a talented Senior Developer looking for a remote job that lets you show your skills and get decent compensation? Look no further than <a href=\"https://lemon.io/for-developers/?utm_source=workingnomads&amp;utm_medium=job_ad&amp;utm_campaign=supply_en_php_react/vue/angular/laravel_oct_2026_job_ad\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Lemon.io</a> — the marketplace that connects you with hand-picked startups in the US and Europe.</p>\n<p><strong>What we offer:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The rate depends on your seniority level, skills and experience. We've already paid out over $11M to our engineers.</li>\n<li>No more hunting for clients or negotiating rates — let us handle the business side of things so you can focus on what you do best.</li>\n<li>We'll manually find the best project for you according to your skills and preferences.</li>\n<li>Choose a schedule that works best for you. It’s possible to communicate async or minimally overlap within team working hours.</li>\n<li>We respect your seniority so you can expect no micromanagement or screen trackers.</li>\n<li>Communicate directly with the clients. Most of them have technical backgrounds. Sounds good, yeah?</li>\n<li>We will support you from the time you submit the application throughout all cooperation stages.</li>\n<li>Most of our projects involve working in a fast-paced startup environment. We hope you like it as much as we do.</li>\n<li>Through our community, we will connect you with the best developers from more than 75 countries.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We have several senior positions available. We are looking for Senior Software Engineers with strong knowledge of the following stacks: React &amp; PHP, Angular &amp; PHP, Vue &amp; PHP, and PHP &amp; Laravel.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements for Senior React &amp; PHP Developer experience:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>4+ years of software development experience</li>\n<li>3+ years of experience with React</li>\n<li>3+ years of commercial experience with PHP/Laravel</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements for Senior Angular &amp; PHP Developer experience:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>4+ years of software development experience</li>\n<li>3+ years of experience with Angular and 3+ years of commercial experience with PHP</li>\n<li>3+ years of commercial experience with Laravel is required</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements for Senior PHP &amp; Vue.js Developer experience:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>4+ years of software development experience</li>\n<li>3+ years of experience with PHP and 3+ years of commercial experience with Vue.js</li>\n<li>Practical experience with Laravel is required</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements for Senior Laravel &amp; PHP Developer experience:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>4+ years of software development experience</li>\n<li>3+ years of commercial experience with PHP &amp; Laravel</li>\n<li>Practical experience with AWS/GCP/Azure is required</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Other requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong technical skills: as a Senior Developer, you are expected to be able to create projects from scratch and have a deep understanding of application architecture.</li>\n<li>Clear and effective communication in English — advanced ability to discuss business tasks, justify decisions, and communicate issues. Good self-presentation is also essential for upcoming client calls.</li>\n<li>Strong self-organizational skills — ability to work full-time remotely with no supervision.</li>\n<li>Reliability — we want to trust you and expect that you won’t let us and the client down.</li>\n<li>Adaptability and Flexibility — the ability to onboard the project promptly after accepting it and start delivering results quickly.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Sounds good for you? Apply now and join the <a href=\"https://lemon.io/for-developers/?utm_source=workingnomads&amp;utm_medium=job_ad&amp;utm_campaign=supply_en_php_react/vue/angular/laravel_oct_2026_job_ad\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Lemon.io</a> community!</p>\n<p><strong>NOT YOUR TECH STACK?</strong></p>\n<p>We're placing Senior Developers (4+ yrs commercial experience) across AI Agent Architecture, AI Automation Architecture, AI Engineering, Site Reliability Engineering, Platform Engineering, Enterprise Software Engineering, React &amp; Python, React &amp; Golang, Golang, React &amp; Java, React &amp; Ruby, Ruby, Vue &amp; Node.js, React &amp; .NET, Android &amp; iOS, iOS &amp; Swift, Flutter &amp; Firebase, Solutions Engineer, Blockchain (Ethereum/Ethers.js/Wagmi/Viem/Solana), Angular &amp; Node.js, Vue &amp; .NET, Python &amp; Vue, DevOps, MLOps, Data Science, Angular &amp; .NET, Symfony &amp; React, Symfony &amp; Vue, Symfony &amp; Angular, Python, Symfony &amp; JavaScript &amp; Next.js &amp; TypeScript, Data Analysis, Data Engineering, Project Management, Product Management, QA Automation, QA Manual, Embedded Software Engineering, React Native &amp; Node, React Native &amp; React, React Native &amp; Ruby, React Native &amp; Python, WordPress, Android, Angular, Python &amp; Node, React &amp; Node.js, Java &amp; Spring, Svelte &amp; Python, Svelte &amp; Node.js, Svelte &amp; TypeScript, Rust, Shopify &amp; JavaScript, Vue &amp; Nuxt, UI/UX Design, Animation, Graphic Design, React &amp; Node &amp; React Native, .NET &amp; C#, Electron, Scala, C++, Unreal Engine &amp; C++, Python &amp; LLM, Unity, or Machine Learning Engineering and more. Reach out and we'll match you.</p>\n<p>We do not provide visa assistance, and our cooperation model does not include the benefits typically offered with direct hire.</p>\n<p>We work with developers from 75+ countries across Europe, Latin America, North America (the U.S. and Canada), selected countries in Asia (Japan, Singapore, South Korea, the Philippines, Indonesia, Malaysia, Vietnam, Thailand, and Israel), Oceania (Australia, New Zealand, and Papua New Guinea), and Africa (including Morocco and South Africa).</p>",
  "company_name": "Lemon.io",
  "category_name": "Development",
  "tags": "php,react,angular,vuejs,laravel",
